{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411390","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411390","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1241139001:1":{"text":"ルカさん、そのベルトとても素敵ですね。","source_cn":"卢卡先生，你这条腰带好精致呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEB4F264AFD7F615","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241139002:1":{"text":"これか？これは地下ボクシング試合で勝ったときのチャンピオンベルトだ。","source_cn":"这个？冠军腰带，我从地下拳击场赢来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x195E5CE07F15C8AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241139003:1":{"text":"力を持つ者である証明さ。","source_cn":"是力量的证明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x392F7D6DDB8E9AEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241139004:1":{"text":"これをつけていると、テシオに付き従っていた奴らもおいそれと突っかかってこない。","source_cn":"戴着它，跟着泰西欧干的那群废物就没胆挑衅我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA7CA5DCA2D17BA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"ルカ","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}